                "a": "(i) (−10) − (+6) = (−10) + (−6) = −16\n(ii) (−20) − (−10) = (−20) + (+10) = −10\n(iii) (−7) − (−8) = (−7) + (+8) = +1\n(iv) (+20) − (+15) = (+20) + (−15) = +5\n(v) (+14) − (−6) = (+14) + (+6) = +20\n(vi) (−6) − (−9) = (−6) + (+9) = +3"
