                "a": "(i) (+6) + (−10) = −(10 − 6) = −4\n(ii) (−10) + (−4) = −(10 + 4) = −14\n(iii) (−8) + (+5) = −(8 − 5) = −3\n(iv) (+20) − (−10) = (+20) + (+10) = +30\n(v) (−20) − (−15) = (−20) + (+15) = −5\n(vi) (+40) − (+25) = (+40) + (−25) = +15"
