                "a": "(i) 10 × 5 = 50\n(+10) × (−5) = −50\n(ii) 6 × 9 = 54\n(−6) × (−9) = +54\n(iii) 20 × 6 = 120\n(+20) × (+6) = +120\n(iv) 15 × 3 = 45\n(−15) × (+3) = −45\n(v) 6 × 0 = 0\n(+6) × 0 = 0\n(vi) 10 × 8 = 80\n(−10) × (−8) = +80"
