                    "a": "If we look at the creation of this universe, we will come to know that the sun, the moon and the stars are rotating on their fixed orbits. The rising of the day and the appearance of the night, the changing of the seasons and the pouring of heavy rain, all these things are happening in a systematic way and regularly, which assures that the who so ever controls the system of this universe, is only One. When a small thing like a needle, etc. cannot exist in this world without a maker, then how can this whole universe exist without a creator! And the creator is none other than Allah Almighty.",
